s the archived S0 ladder fit of the same key, rung, arm, and learner seed bit for bit on its validation predictions.\n\nThe analyses, preconditions, and results README are in `artifacts/descriptor-information/shift-transfer/`. The shifted datasets regenerate from the rule and `tools/shift_transfer.py generate`; their dataset hashes are recorded in `prepare.json`.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/405393885","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/405393885/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/405393885/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/tag/exact-labels-oracle-v1","id":405393885,"author":{"login":"yzhao062","id":15079146,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDc5MTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15079146?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062","html_url":"https://github.com/yzhao062","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTdFVMs4YKdHd","tag_name":"exact-labels-oracle-v1","target_commitish":"87870daac359c6fa4d75f4208bc2242685c8fcbf","name":"Exact labels, Bayes oracle, and pooling (rule 2026-10-06)","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-07T01:28:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T04:59:00Z