6830ec9c328c172a343fc","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-06T17:36:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T17:36:16Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/download/confirmation-v1/mlqem-own-data-v1.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/tarball/confirmation-v1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/zipball/confirmation-v1","body":"The fits and datasets of three rules committed at `b04f49b` before any dataset or fit they govern, as reported in the QEMScore paper (the new-seed confirmation, the crossed follow-ups, and Experiment 4). The analyses, predictions, scores, logs, and the scripts as run are in `artifacts/descriptor-information/round8/` and `artifacts/mlqem-own-data/` at this tag; each README gives the commands.\n\nThis tag points at `0152dd5`, the commit that added those results.\n\n| Asset | Bytes | SHA-256 | Files |\n|---|---:|---|---:|\n| `descriptor-information-fresh-v1.tar.xz` | 1,309,808,828 | `1bfcdb1c46938013cbb9d743f61c2e441aceb17dbcced5e9d0f6fb9dcb115e15` | 177,906 |\n| `descriptor-information-crossed-follow-ups-v1.tar.xz` | 726,032,300 | `e341be45e244f90fa14ae524281f577479e2a6aaaef135894c12cbcb32e615c2` | 22,074 |\n| `mlqem-own-data-v1.tar.gz` | 43,676,096 | `fc6303e3186523d889b81754a0a09f929d2b91e36496830ec9c328c172a343fc` | 438 fits and encoded matrices |\n\n- `descriptor-information-fresh-v1`: the new dataset seeds 401, 503, and 607 at seven shot levels (generated on macOS after the rule was pushed), every level's prepared caches and cache records, every fit of both candidate sets with per-candidate predictions, the predictions file written before any fit of F or P, the generation reports with the 141,367-file hash list, and the DeltaAI run log. Rule `docs/frozen-rules/2026-10-04-fresh-confirmation.md`.\n- `descriptor-information-crossed-follow-ups-v1`: every fit of parts B (stronger candidates at six shot levels), C (early-stopped MLP), D (learner seeds 21 to 40), and G (training sizes 40 to 320) with per-candidate predictions, their analyses, and the DeltaAI run log. Part G's 640-circuit reference fits are included as files (copies of the shot-sweep and strong-learner fits of release `descriptor-information-v1`). Parts E and H fit nothing; their outputs are in the repository. Rule `docs/frozen-rules/2026-10-04-crossed-follow-ups.md`.\n- `mlqem-own-data-v1`: the 438 fits (predictions and records) of the capacity-matched control on ML-QEM's own simulated data, and the encoded feature matrices with the SHA-256 of their inputs. The ML-QEM data are not redistributed; `qiskit-community/ml-qem` at commit `b1eccf8` and `reanalysis/mlqem/upstream_data_sha256.json` identify them. Rule `docs/frozen-rules/2026-10-04-mlqem-own-data.md`.\n\n```bash\ncurl -L -O https://github.com/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/download/confirmation-v1/descriptor-information-fresh-v1.tar.xz\nshasum -a 256 descriptor-information-fresh-v1.tar.xz\ntar -xJf descriptor-information-fresh-v1.tar.xz\n```\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/403222713","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/403222713/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/403222713/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/tag/descriptor-information-v1","id":403222713,"author":{"login":"yzhao062","id":15079146,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDc5MTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15079146?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062","html_url":"https://github.com/yzhao062","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/subsc