{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-xz","state":"uploaded","size":89990540,"digest":"sha256:9cf19a499122cdff92560333cb2a91b2fcdd098ad8fe0cb95e166f7d186dfa57","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-04T21:45:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T21:45:42Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/download/descriptor-information-v1/descriptor-information-v1.tar.xz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/tarball/descriptor-information-v1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/zipball/descriptor-information-v1","body":"The fits of the descriptor-information experiment and its three follow-ups reported in the QEMScore paper (Experiment 3 and Appendix O). The original rule was frozen before its new-rung and new-dataset fits and reused earlier R0 fits; each follow-up rule was committed before its fits. The rule and the commit that froze it are listed per asset. The analyses, summaries, and post hoc records that read these fits are in `artifacts/descriptor-information/` at this tag, and `artifacts/descriptor-information/README.md` gives every command.\n\nThis tag points at `431d101`. Its `artifacts/descriptor-information/posthoc-stacking-pins.json` records, read directly from these four archives, the SHA-256 of each archive and of the 13,200 fit files the post hoc stacking reads.\n\n| Asset | Bytes | SHA-256 | Files |\n|---|---:|---|---:|\n| `descriptor-information-v1.tar.xz` | 89,990,540 | `9cf19a499122cdff92560333cb2a91b2fcdd098ad8fe0cb95e166f7d186dfa57` | 5,052 |\n| `descriptor-information-strength-v1.tar.xz` | 99,746,872 | `d9bc11b4eed70d90f7b3c605c1b1eb3c9656d15fbc83b2c20fe7511a7bdae170` | 5,004 |\n| `descriptor-information-strong-learners-v1.tar.xz` | 236,818,824 | `80fcccc657fafcfe68d55a899cf5008977c2e6e7e0994cffadb4e71a32d04643` | 8,797 |\n| `descriptor-information-shot-sweep-v1.tar.xz` | 409,030,636 | `d39969f21e77e4ab33a1daaa7b8daedf4b93cb9753c569d575af0ec631971b16` | 151,688 |\n\n- `descriptor-information-v1`: every fit of the original experiment (Parts A and B and the near-Clifford rungs, learner seeds 1 to 20, with per-candidate predictions) and the slim cached test items the analyses read. Rule `docs/frozen-rules/2026-10-02-descriptor-information.md`, frozen at `4c95174`; records added at `9b8c727`.\n- `descriptor-information-strength-v1`: the strength-indicator rerun, in which every arm also reads the noise strength. Fits only; it reads the caches of `descriptor-information-v1`. Rule `docs/frozen-rules/2026-10-03-strength-indicator.md`, frozen at `f24a482`.\n- `descriptor-information-strong-learners-v1`: the strong-learner rerun (a tuned boosted tree and, at Part A rungs with couplings, a ridge-regularized coupling polynomial join the candidates), Part A and Part B fits, the derived same-platform baseline fits, and the run log. Rule `docs/frozen-rules/2026-10-03-strong-learners.md`, frozen at `832ec36`.\n- `descriptor-information-shot-sweep-v1`: the shot-count sweep at seven levels (256 to 131,072 shots and the exact noisy expectation): each level's datasets with manifests and counts sidecars, each level's fits and caches at rungs R0, N1, N2, and R5, and the run reports and log. Rule `docs/frozen-rules/2026-10-03-shot-sweep.md`, frozen at `479a9a0`.\n\nResults of the two follow-ups run on DeltaAI were committed at `6a3dc4e`; the post hoc reporting checks (stacking increment, validation-error-scale ceiling, joint bands, and the pins) at `431d101`.\n\n```bash\ncurl -L -O https://github.com/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/download/descriptor-information-v1/descriptor-information-v1.tar.xz\nshasum -a 256 descriptor-information-v1.tar.xz\ntar -xJf descriptor-information-v1.tar.xz\n```\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/385047785","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/385047785/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/385047785/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/tag/campaign-archive-v1","id":385047785,"author":{"login":"yzhao062","id":15079146,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDc5MTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15079146?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062","html_url":"https://github.com/yzhao062","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzhao062/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTdFVMs4W81zp","tag_name":"campaign-archive-v1","target_commitish":"main","name":"Campaign archive v1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-09-08T20:37:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T20:39:02Z","published_at":"2026-09-08T20:39:02Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yzhao062/QEMScore/releases/assets/551268928","id":551268928,"node_id":"RA_kwDOTdFVMs4g27JA","name":"campaign-archive-v1.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"yzhao062","id":15079146,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDc5MTQ2","avata